            "detailed_description": "Booster Trooper is the future of multiplayer platform shooters.  It provides tons of fun with its fast paced action and larger-than-life weapons. You can run or fly around the map, blasting your enemies to bits with bullets, rockets, grenades, magma and other weapons from your arsenal.<br><br>\t\t\t\t\tWhether you play it against the BOTs or a live player, Booster Trooper will constantly keep you on the edge! Rankings, co-operation, tactics and split second decisions will deliver hours and hours of online multiplayer entertainment!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2>\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fast paced, adrenaline packed game play.<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>12 Player Multiplayer.<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>More than 15 Maps<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Various weapons, ranging from assault rifle, shotgun, sniper rifle to minigun, magma thrower and more.<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Each weapon is unique, requiring different approach &amp; tactics.<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Online ranking boards.<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>More than 250 Achievements<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Single player vs. bots supported.<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Deathmatch, Team DM, Capture the Flag, Destroy the base and more…<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Ships with dedicated server software<br>\t\t\t\t\t</li></ul>",
